
== Data Gathering Techniques
JU Link is a platform built by students, for students but despite that, we still had to consider the input of other stakeholders in our software development process. To gather this information, we used two main techniques:
=== Questionnaires
We followed the funnel technique in the creation process of our questionnaire as it reached a problem not many students feel comfortable talking about. 

A summary of some of the questionnaire results is provided in Appendix A.
=== Interviews
To supplement the questionnaire, we also carried out a series of individual interviews with preselected students in order to explore their experiences and expectations in detail. The interviews enabled us to probe matters in detail and to gain additional perspectives that might not have been revealed in the questionnaire.

A summary of the main themes and results from the interviews can be found in Appendix B.

